{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300266639","label":"clothing","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/1796","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"1796","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"accession number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300312355"}],"content":"2000.3.407a-b","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Dress Smock and Sash","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Marimekko","id":"actor/430","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Annika Rimala","id":"actor/1030","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"a: Dress, Black and green wide stripe cotton, patch pockets, \"Marimekko\". b:  Belt does not seem to be used. Black and green fabric sash. Name of the dress Asumistakki, 1963. Pattern called Galleria by Vuokko Numrmesniemi in 1957.  a: Calf length button-down smock with 8 buttons and two square patch pockets and three-quarter sleeves wide green and black stripes. Black buttons and stand-up collar. Print: \"Galleria\" by Vuokko Nurmesnieki, 1957. Dress: A Sumistakki, 1963 at collar\"Marimekko Soumi-Finland\",  under collar laundry instructions.  Finland?","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Gift of Juan and Anna Marie Hamilton","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},